#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Face Detection with K230 V4L2-DRM - 人脸检测示例

使用 KPU 进行实时人脸检测,并通过 V4L2-DRM 显示结果。

参考: buildroot-overlay/package/face_detect/src/face_detection.cc

Usage:
    python face_detect.py <kmodel_path> [obj_thresh] [nms_thresh]

Example:
    python face_detect.py face_detection_320.kmodel 0.5 0.2
"""

